---
description: Plan HyperFrames films in this Cursor chat, then render with BAML
alwaysApply: true
---

When asked for a video, write a `FilmPlan` JSON that matches `baml_src/film.baml` and run `baml run main -- --plan_file videos/<slug>/plan.json`. That creates `videos/<slug>/` with `plan.json`, the composition, and `renders/`. Render the preview-cut first: `baml run render_cut -- --dir videos/<slug> --cut preview` (HyperFrames quality `draft`, file `renders/preview-cut.mp4`). Render the production-cut second: `baml run render_cut -- --dir videos/<slug> --cut production` (quality `delivery`, file `renders/production-cut.mp4`). An extra take is `baml run render_take -- --dir videos/<slug> --quality looks --take <take>`. The subscription model in this chat is the planner. Do not call an external model API and do not ask for an API key.
